# Smoke 8, pre-send, windows: Queue on the open return, in the dry-run test build only (the default suite never presses it). Queue validates first: a return that does not pass Check stops at its to-do.
# (open-2551q-windows.wants already set the profile facts and For-the this return validates against.)
# What validation still wants is in the to-do list and in Part I: capture the list, jump to Part I and answer its
# items (income type goes to the profile inline, exactly what the box says).
click fp-pill-list --screenshot
click fp-nav-attention --screenshot
click 'fp-ask-tax_classification-choices-"SelfEmployed"'
type fp-frm2551Qv2018:telNo 09170000000
type fp-txtEmail#occurrence-1 e2e@example.com
click fp-frm2551Qv2018:taxTreaty_2 --screenshot
# The profile's graduated income-tax election lets sheet-press leave a non-zero PT010 row, and money-boxes re-zeroes
# Items 15/16 after its asserts so they validate. Then jump back to the top: deep in the scroll the toolbar is
# culled from the tree and fp-queue is gone.
click fp-frm2551Qv2018:taxRateNA --screenshot
click fp-nav-0 --screenshot
click fp-check
wait_until 'No problems found.' --timeout-ms 10000 --screenshot
wait_until fp-queue --timeout-ms 5000 --screenshot
wait_until queue-confirm --timeout-ms 1000 --absent
